'''Gastrodon''' (Japanese: '''トリトドン''' ''Tritodon'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

