==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Gastrodon}} in both its {{form|Shellos|West Sea and East Sea}} forms in both of its illustrations.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Gastrodon|29}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*{{m|Muddy Water}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gastrodon}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

